From 22d51d49c22946bdf2832aad9d6759a1f34541df Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Claude <noreply@anthropic.com>
Date: Wed, 18 Nov 2026 22:37:12 -0500
Subject: [PATCH] Oceananigans #6538 as a run-time override: [grid]
 partial_cell_fix = "6538"

vertical_divergence_fix.jl copies #6538 (commit 807ef5c) into the Oceananigans
that NumericalEarth uses: the vertical-advection divergence of
WENOVectorInvariant with the velocity difference upwinded and the area
difference (and z-star term) interpolated symmetrically, for self and cross
upwinding. partial_cell_fix = true or "6533" keeps #6533's flux form;
"6538" uses this instead; false neither.

Two test configs: config_smoke_test_fix6538.toml (100 km, Jan 1993) and
config_sep2005_30d_fix6538.toml (15 km, 50 levels, September 2005).

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
Claude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_01Abhhvm7xByUXxouq5u8r5W
